      "message": "[error] Line 661: 🔴 The per-device throttle is still gated by `!conv-\u003epending`. If another device has an in-flight clone, a device already recorded in `cloneFailedDevices` bypasses the backoff and `startFetch()` adds it to the same pending fetch; subsequent sync/fallback callbacks can retry that failed device before `nextCloneAttempt`, defeating the change and recreating connection storms. Check `cloneThrottled(deviceId)` independently of `conv-\u003epending` in both clone entry points (the per-device set already allows unfailed devices to join the round).",
